That's kind of a format.

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:09.280
Or you can do architecture documentation.

00:24:09.280 --> 00:24:11.760
Then we add skills.
That's the important thing.

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:13.360
A lot of people were talking about that.

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:18.840
And we also have MCP source
